                <pb facs="0639" n="625" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg625"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">896.001 Roxas/4–1548: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in the Philippines
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-04-15">April 15, 1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>473. Following press statement being released by President: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I am deeply shocked at the news of the sudden death of President Manuel
                            Roxas of the Philippines. In his passing, the Philippine people have
                            lost a great leader and the United States of America a true friend.</p>
                        <p>He assumed office as President when his war-ravaged country was faced
                            with the most staggering problems. His untimely death in itself is
                            evidence of the energy which he brought to the restoration of the
                            Philippines and to the service of his people. The officials of this
                            Government with whom he came in contact have been unanimous in their
                            praise of his far-seeing vision and statesmanship. His sure leadership
                            of the people of the Philippines and his courageous faith in his country
                            may well serve as an inspiration to the people of all lands.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
